# Mosquitto ACL — AGW Edge Gateway
# Formato: user <username> / topic <permission> <topic-pattern>

# ── ESP32 nodes (SOIL / HYDRO) ──────────────────────────────────
user esp32_node
topic readwrite agw/node/#
topic read agw/gateway/commands/#

# ── Edge Controller (full access) ───────────────────────────────
user edge_controller
topic readwrite #
